{"3872430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCP: Project Pneuma", "steam_appid": 3872430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/6a37a1bc980332dcc765965760eec264.avif?t=1785207605\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>The world ended the moment the Foundation lost control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCP: Project Pneuma</i> is a single-player psychological survival horror experience set during the aftermath of <strong>Project Echelon</strong>, a secret protocol that shattered containment across the globe. As <strong>Dr Alexander Kolchak</strong>, a SCP Foundation researcher and one of the few survivors of <strong>Site-63</strong>, you must journey across a haunted exclusion zone to reach <strong>Site-19</strong>—and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you go, the more the world twists. Reality warps. Familiar places corrode. You're being hunted—not just by anomalies like <strong>SCP-173Z, SCP-096Z, SCP-939Z, SCP-239Z</strong>, but by your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened through journals, voice logs, and environmental storytelling. Confront horrific SCPs with stealth, scarce resources, and quick thinking. Endure hallucinations that test what’s real—and what isn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/10942d7d13a6b110d881b3e50b4d0ece.avif?t=1785207605\" width=615 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll navigate Site-63's ruins using stealth and scarce resources — there is no winning a fight against SCP-106. The hallucinations aren't just atmospheric. They will make you question which doors are real. because the Foundation never wrote down what it couldn't explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This communicates the same features but keeps the reader inside the world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/6a37a1bc980332dcc765965760eec264.avif?t=1785207605\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong>The world ended the moment the Foundation lost control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>SCP: Project Pneuma</i> is a single-player psychological survival horror experience set during the aftermath of <strong>Project Echelon</strong>, a secret protocol that shattered containment across the globe. As <strong>Dr Alexander Kolchak</strong>, a SCP Foundation researcher and one of the few survivors of <strong>Site-63</strong>, you must journey across a haunted exclusion zone to reach <strong>Site-19</strong>—and the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the deeper you go, the more the world twists. Reality warps. Familiar places corrode. You're being hunted—not just by anomalies like <strong>SCP-173Z, SCP-096Z, SCP-939Z, SCP-239Z</strong>, but by your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what happened through journals, voice logs, and environmental storytelling. Confront horrific SCPs with stealth, scarce resources, and quick thinking. Endure hallucinations that test what’s real—and what isn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/extras/10942d7d13a6b110d881b3e50b4d0ece.avif?t=1785207605\" width=615 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll navigate Site-63's ruins using stealth and scarce resources — there is no winning a fight against SCP-106. The hallucinations aren't just atmospheric. They will make you question which doors are real. because the Foundation never wrote down what it couldn't explain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This communicates the same features but keeps the reader inside the world.</p>", "short_description": "The Foundation has fallen. Site-63 is gone. You are Dr Alexander - and whatever is hunting you knows exactly where you're going. SCP: Project Pneuma. A psychological survival horror experience set during the collapse of everything", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/0758a2bc8d562245d2a29ff090e59d44c5529ae7/header.jpg?t=1785207605", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/e5d4a1509feaea40c665c250863c0e89884c5a65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785207605", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872430/e5d4a1509feaea40c665c250863c0e89884c5a65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785207605", "website": "https://zatun.com/games/scp-project-pneuma/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 Core 12 Threads<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1650 or AMD RX 6500XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong>